  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rusitu Valley Banana Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen internal control systems and establish policies and procedures in administration, production and marketing of produce from the farmers. The project will increase the competitiveness of the organization through improving planning, provision of adequate production loans, fruit production and maximize production per unit area and quality of the bananas it supplies to the market.</narrative>
  </description>
